    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "0abb49f870d9fbcdbca0": "I am interested in warlock training.",
        "3ae968086263cd627ea8": "The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that.",
        "553c0aa324ee0372296f": "The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!",
        "ef131155e9c467654881": "I am interested in warlock training.",
        "f2841a43eebc3f2574a2": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"
      },
      "name": "Drusilla La Salle",
      "subName": "Warlock Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
